From e2844b2246ddaed23c803d21e35a3ca8a5363764 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 08:20:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "Drop support for Darwin on PowerPC"

This reverts commit 957caeef237c0cf924615487bc475b4ba3ac6803.

Part of restoring what https://github.com/ruby/ruby/pull/19183 dropped.

